2026-08-20T17:10:07.5782065Z [36;1m#   216 ERROR_EXE_MACHINE_TYPE_MISMATCH - "not a valid application for this OS platform"[0m
2026-08-20T17:10:07.5782622Z [36;1m# Both are the architecture rejection this control is testing for. Anything[0m
